{"ref":"BDB, מִדְיָן","hw":"מִדְיָן","html":"<big><span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיָן</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  son of Abraham and Keturah <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:2\" href=\"/Genesis.25.2\">Gn 25:2</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:4\" href=\"/Genesis.25.4\">4</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:32\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.32\">1 Ch 1:32</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:33\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.33\">33</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  an Arabian tribe <a data-ref=\"Genesis 36:35\" href=\"/Genesis.36.35\">Gn 36:35</a> (= <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 1:46\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.1.46\">1 Ch 1:46</a>) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:3\" href=\"/Numbers.31.3\">Nu 31:3</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:7\" href=\"/Numbers.31.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:8\" href=\"/Numbers.31.8\">8</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:9\" href=\"/Numbers.31.9\">9</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Judges 6-9\" href=\"/Judges.6-9\">Ju 6–9</a> (31 times); having a <span dir=\"rtl\">כֹּהֵן</span> (as chieftain?) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:16\" href=\"/Exodus.2.16\">Ex 2:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:1\" href=\"/Exodus.3.1\">3:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:1\" href=\"/Exodus.18.1\">18:1</a> (E); <span dir=\"rtl\">זקנים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:4\" href=\"/Numbers.22.4\">Nu 22:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:7\" href=\"/Numbers.22.7\">7</a> (JE), <span dir=\"rtl\">נשׂיא(ים)</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:18\" href=\"/Numbers.25.18\">Nu 25:18</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:21\" href=\"/Joshua.13.21\">Jos 13:21</a> (P), <span dir=\"rtl\">שׂרים</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 7:25\" href=\"/Judges.7.25\">Ju 7:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:3\" href=\"/Judges.8.3\">8:3</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מלכים</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 31:8\" href=\"/Numbers.31.8\">Nu 31:8</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:5\" href=\"/Judges.5.5\">Ju 5:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:12\" href=\"/Judges.5.12\">12</a>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 5:26\" href=\"/Judges.5.26\">26</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">בִּכְרֵי מִדְיָן</span> <em>dromedaries of Midian</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 60:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.60.6\">Is 60:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יוֹם מִדְיָן</span> <em>day of Midian</em> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.3\">Is 9:3</a> (the victory over Midian <a data-ref=\"Judges 7-8\" href=\"/Judges.7-8\">Ju 7–8</a>) cf. <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 10:26\" href=\"/Isaiah.10.26\">10:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 83:10\" href=\"/Psalms.83.10\">ψ 83:10</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרֶץ מִדְיָן</span> <em>the land of Midian</em> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 2:15\" href=\"/Exodus.2.15\">Ex 2:15</a> (E) <a data-ref=\"Habakkuk 3:7\" href=\"/Habakkuk.3.7\">Hb 3:7</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מִדְיָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:19\" href=\"/Exodus.4.19\">Ex 4:19</a> (J) <a data-ref=\"Numbers 25:15\" href=\"/Numbers.25.15\">Nu 25:15</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.18\">1 K 11:18</a>; land of Ælantic gulf (where Arabic geographers still place town <span dir=\"rtl\">مدين</span>). Cf. on Midian, Glaser<sup>Skizze ii. 447 ff.</sup>; Hom<sup>Aufsätze i. (1892), 4 f.</sup>","next":"BDB, מִדְיָנִי","prev":"BDB, מְדָן"}